/*
 * Root module for template solving(explicit + implicit).
 *
 * TemplateSolving unifies the two major template specialization systems:
 *
 *   - Explicit template solving:
 *        User-provided template arguments, e.g.  Foo!(i32, 42)
 *
 *   - Implicit template solving:
 *        Template inference from call-site expressions, e.g.  foo(12)
 *
 * It provides the high-level entry points used by:
 *   - call validation,
 *   - overload resolution,
 *   - template instantiation,
 *   - method and constructor template calls.
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::template_::solve
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/template_/solve.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-09
